ion, including civil liability for distribution of abortion-inducing drugs, and to the destruction of certain property; making confor" -- filed a bill restricting abortion-inducing drugs; 89(R) SB 33, as cosponsor: "Relating to certain prohibited transactions and logistical support between a governmental entity and an abortion assistance entity or abortion provide" -- filed a bill barring governmental support for obtaining an abortion. ⚠ WHAT THIS DOES AND DOES NOT SETTLE. The instrument places this member firmly on their side of the ladder; it does not by itself separate the rungs WITHIN that side, and the chair keeps the placement the original research gave it. Registered as a ladder-reachability finding rather than silently absorbed.', ARRAY['http://journals.house.texas.gov/hjrnl/87r/pdf/87RDAY41FINAL.PDF', 'https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=87R&Bill=HB1173', 'https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=87R&Bill=SB650', 'https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=88R&Bill=HB61', 'https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=892&Bill=HB7', 'https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=89R&Bill=HB1806', 'https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=89R&Bill=HB5510', 'https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=89R&Bill=SB33', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shelby_Slawson']::text[]),
